    "title": "Woodoku - Wood Block Puzzle",
    "description": "Woodoku: a wood block puzzle game meets sudoku grid. Woodoku is a relaxing yet challenging wood-block-puzzle that you\u2019ll be addicted to in no time!\r\n\r\nRelax & test your IQ with our logic puzzle games for adults! Place wood blocks in the 9x9 board & fill rows, columns, or squares to clear blocks of daily puzzle. Play the wood block puzzle for as long as you can without running out of space to beat your high score in this brain training games! Play hours of addictive games & logic puzzle with Woodoku! You can even play our addictive puzzle games for adults offline. Need brain training games? Play our wooden puzzle block games today!\r\n\r\nFeatures of Woodoku - the wood block puzzle game for adults:\r\n* Beautiful graphics, addicting puzzle games for adults & satisfying sound effects\r\n* Logic puzzle block game game experience with realistic woody puzzle tile design\r\n* Relaxing wood block puzzle with no time limit\r\n* A light, small woody puzzle game that won\u2019t take up space on your device\r\n* Playable offline so you can enjoy hours of woody puzzle fun & mind games with our wood block game anywhere!\r\n* 100\u2019s of new wood block puzzles & daily puzzle solving games every week + the daily puzzle brings new challenges everyday in fun, mind games!\r\n\r\nLogic puzzle Woodoku is a highly addictive wood block puzzle game offering a unique twist on the classic Sudoku game. With beautiful graphics & challenging brain training games, endless wood block puzzle gameplay, Woodoku\u2019s mind games will keep you engaged & entertained for hours with daily puzzle & block game. Download Woodoku wood block puzzle now & see for yourself why millions love our logic puzzle & brain training games!\r\n\r\nWoodoku is a wood block game that\u2019s easy to learn, but a challenging brain training games to master! Play this wood-block-puzzle game for adults every day to sharpen your mind. Relax with Woodoku\u2019s addictive block puzzle solving games. Not familiar with our block mind games puzzle games for adults or addicting block games? \r\n\r\nHow to play Woodoku - the wood block puzzle games for adults:\r\n* Drag the wood block puzzle pieces onto the grid\r\n* Play woody puzzle block games by filling a row, column, or square to clear wood blocks from the board\r\n* Clear rows, lines, or squares of wood blocks daily puzzle & earn Combo points in the puzzle solving games\r\n* Merge the woody puzzle blocks on every turn to earn Streak points in block mind games!\r\n* Earn as many points as you can to beat your highest block puzzle mind games score!\r\n* Solve mind games & block games for brain training games!\r\n*Relax with block game & puzzles\r\n* Have yourself a woody good time by playing these addicting puzzle games for adults & mind games with beautiful woody puzzle pieces!\r\n\r\nWoodoku Woody Puzzle & Block Games Journey\r\nLove Woodoku\u2019s endless block puzzle games for adults & addicting games? Enjoy new puzzle solving games & mind games challenges? Play the journey-themed Woodoku block game with new endless block puzzle games for adults every week! Each Woodoku woody puzzle game has a different goal. Along the way of brain training games, collect gems & amazing wood block awards! For more addicting games & brain training games try the daily puzzle! Woodoku is the best wood block puzzle game with simple addictive game! Woodoku\u2019s addictive block puzzle game levels will provide hours of fun in relaxing & satisfying games!\r\n\r\nDaily Puzzles & Block Puzzle Games For Adults\r\nWant new puzzle solving games & addicting games? Try the daily puzzles & mind games! New wood block puzzles & puzzle solving games added every day. Match the wood puzzle tiles & earn gems in block games to keep up your streak. Woodoku\u2019s block puzzle solving games help train your brain with addictive games & endless block puzzles\r\n\r\nBlock puzzle games for adults are perfect to relax. If you\u2019re looking for a new addictive daily puzzle game for adults like sudoku or wood puzzle games you\u2019ll love the block game Woodoku, try this addictive woody block puzzle game today!",
